---
import '@fontsource-variable/dm-sans';
import '../styles/global.css';
import Analytics from '../components/Analytics.astro';
const analyticsConfigured = /^G-[A-Z0-9]+$/.test(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID || '');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><title>Privacy Policy — Kristijan Lenković</title><meta name="description" content="How this website handles contact requests, optional analytics, and local preferences." /><link rel="canonical" href={new URL('/privacy/', Astro.site)} /><script is:inline>
  (() => { let theme; try { theme = localStorage.getItem('theme'); } catch {} document.documentElement.dataset.theme = theme === 'light' || theme === 'dark' ? theme : (matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').matches ? 'light' : 'dark'); })();
</script></head>
<body><main class="privacy-page"><a href="/">← Back to the website</a><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <h2>Contact requests</h2><p>Kristijan Lenković is responsible for this website. Use its contact form for requests about your data. Your contact details and message are used to respond to your enquiry. Service providers process requests, deliver email, and help protect the form from spam; they may process technical information such as network identifiers and delivery records. Messages remain in my mailbox and its backups until deleted. Your contact details and message are not included in analytics events. Your CV request is reviewed and answered personally.</p>
  <h2>Optional analytics</h2><p>{analyticsConfigured ? 'Google Analytics is available only if you accept optional analytics.' : 'Google Analytics is not currently configured.'} It measures page visits, opening the CV form, and successful requests. Advertising personalization and Google Signals are disabled in the site configuration. Page query strings and fragments are excluded from the page URL supplied to Analytics.</p><p>You may decline or withdraw consent using “Analytics preferences.” On withdrawal, this site removes accessible Google Analytics cookies and reloads with tracking disabled. Withdrawal does not delete data already received by Google.</p>
  <button type="button" class="privacy-preferences" data-analytics-settings hidden>Analytics preferences</button>
  <h2>Local preferences</h2><p>Your theme preference is stored in your browser. Your analytics choice is remembered for up to 180 days. Google Analytics may set first-party analytics cookies after you accept. Your browser settings can clear cookies and local storage.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your contact information through the contact form. Requests are handled under applicable data protection rules. You may also contact the Croatian data protection authority, <a href="https://azop.hr/">AZOP</a>.</p>
  <p>For information about optional analytics, see the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy policy</a>.</p>
</main><Analytics /><script src="../scripts/analytics.ts"></script></body></html>
